sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Holder as Holder (Sinh viên)
    participant HolderPortal as Holder Portal
    participant Verifier as Verifier (Nhà tuyển dụng)
    participant VerifyPortal as Verify Portal
    participant SDK as EIP-712 SDK
    participant RPC as Ethereum RPC
    participant Registry as CredentialRegistry
    participant IssuerReg as IssuerRegistry

    Note over Holder,IssuerReg: Bước 1: Holder chọnSelective Disclosure
    Holder->>HolderPortal: Đăng nhập (magic link)
    HolderPortal-->>Holder: Danh sách credentials
    Holder->>HolderPortal: Mở credential "Bằng Kỹ sư CS"
    HolderPortal->>Holder: Toggle: hiển thị [fullName, studentId], ẩn [dob, address]
    Holder->>HolderPortal: Tải file credential (chỉ kèm disclosures đã chọn)
    HolderPortal-->>Holder: credential-sd.json

    Note over Holder,IssuerReg: Bước 2: Holder chia sẻ credential
    Holder->>Verifier: Gửi file credential-sd.json + QR code

    Note over Holder,IssuerReg: Bước 3: Verifier xác minh TRUSTLESS (OFFLINE-CAPABLE)
    Verifier->>VerifyPortal: Upload credential-sd.json
    VerifyPortal->>SDK: verifyCredential(file, opts)

    Note right of SDK: OFFLINE STEPS (không cần network)
    SDK->>SDK: 1. Parse JSON + validate schema (zod)
    SDK->>SDK: 2. Recompute publicClaimsHash
    SDK->>SDK: 3. Verify disclosures → so khớp privateClaims[]
    SDK->>SDK: 4. Recompute merkleLeaf
    SDK->>SDK: 5. Verify Merkle proof → root
    SDK->>SDK: 6. ecrecoverTypedData(sig) → issuer.signer

    Note right of SDK: ONLINE STEPS (2 RPC calls)
    SDK->>RPC: 7. isSigner(issuer.signer)
    RPC->>IssuerReg: eth_call
    IssuerReg-->>RPC: true
    RPC-->>SDK: ✓ signer valid
    SDK->>RPC: 8. anchors[merkleRoot] + isRevoked(index)
    RPC->>Registry: eth_call multicall
    Registry-->>RPC: { anchoredAt: 1750000000, revoked: false }
    RPC-->>SDK: ✓ anchored + not revoked

    SDK-->>VerifyPortal: VerificationResult { isValid: true, checks: [...] }
    VerifyPortal-->>Verifier: ✓ Credential HỢP LỆ
    Verifier->>Verifier: Xem chi tiết: fullName=Tran Le Cong Minh,<br/>degree=Ky su KHMT, honors=Gioi

    Note over Holder,IssuerReg: Toàn bộ quá trình ~200-300ms, không phụ thuộc backend HCMUT
